  "description": "SOFGUR crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C74 H105 Gd3 N9 O26,0.33(Gd1 N6 O18). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 12 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.584-3.584 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.69-97.23°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C74H105Gd3N9O26·0.33[Gd(NO3)6]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
